TCB owner 0c93, copy WORD TCB+490 into WORD base12cc, zero-extend WORD+492
into DWORD IRQ12c4, and zero-extend WORD+494 into DWORD DMA12c8. Final EAX
is the DMA word; intermediate MOV AX preserves incoming EAX's upper word.
